            "type": "note",
            "text": "GPU Marching Cubes\n\nGPUMarchingCubesSOP extracts an iso-surface from a 3D volume\nusing a compute shader \u2014 10-100\u00d7 faster than the CPU version.\n\nNoiseVOL generates a 48\u00b3 density field.\nThe compute shader processes all cells in parallel with\natomic vertex append for thread-safe triangle output.\n\nTry adjusting the threshold to see different iso-surfaces,\nor increase NoiseVOL resolution for smoother results.",
